<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>石室秘录 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%9F%B3%E5%AE%A4%E7%A7%98%E5%BD%95/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mtcmp1fx</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sun, 19 Apr 2026 09:56:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%9F%B3%E5%AE%A4%E7%A7%98%E5%BD%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>石室秘录之四序</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-1-xu/</link><pubDate>Sun, 19 Apr 2026 09:55:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-1-xu/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%9F%B3%E5%AE%A4%E7%A7%98%E5%BD%95%E4%B9%8B%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%8F/">石室秘录之四序</category><description>四篇序言均为清代医家陈士铎（字远公）所著《石室秘录》的序文，分别由金以谋、岐伯天师、张仲景真人、吕道人撰写。序文以传奇笔法记述了该书来历，并阐发其医学价值与传世意义。四篇序言共同构建了一个天师传书、仲景阐微、华佗补遗、吕祖引荐的传奇叙事，旨在提升《石室秘录》的神圣性与权威性，并阐明其“寿世寿民”的著书宗旨。</description></item></channel></rss>